---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const title = 'Privacy Policy: No Quiz Answers Stored, No Cookies';
const description =
  'Which Deadly Sin does not store your quiz answers, uses no accounts, and runs cookie-free Cloudflare Web Analytics for aggregate traffic measurement only.';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path="/privacy/"
  type="article"
  publishedTime="2026-11-19"
>
  <Breadcrumbs
    items={[
      { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
      { name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' },
    ]}
  />

  <article class="prose-article mt-4">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 19 November 2026</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect your quiz answers, do not create accounts, do not use advertising or
      tracking cookies, and sell no personal data. The quiz is scored entirely inside your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Quiz answers never leave your device</h2>
    <p>
      Every calculation on this site &mdash; including the fifteen quiz statements, the seven
      dimension scores, and your dominant-sin result &mdash; runs locally in your browser using
      static JavaScript. Your answers are not transmitted to our hosting provider, written to a
      database, logged, or attached to any identifier. Refreshing or closing the page discards them
      permanently.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics: Cloudflare Web Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to measure aggregate traffic such as page
      view counts, referring websites, country-level location, and browser types. Cloudflare Web
      Analytics does not use cookies, does not fingerprint visitors, and does not track
      individuals across websites. The beacon script is loaded only when a site token is
      configured, and the data it produces cannot identify you personally. See Cloudflare&rsquo;s
      own privacy documentation for details of its processing.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no first-party cookies and uses no advertising or cross-site tracking
      services. Browser-local storage is not used to persist quiz responses between visits.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Vercel as a static deployment. Like most hosting providers, Vercel may
      temporarily process standard request metadata (such as IP address and user agent) for
      security, abuse prevention, and platform reliability. We do not combine this metadata with
      quiz activity, because no quiz activity is ever sent to the server.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Because we hold no accounts and no quiz data, there is no profile for us to export or delete.
      Residents of jurisdictions including the EU/UK (GDPR/UK GDPR) and California (CCPA) retain
      their statutory rights regarding any personal data processed by our hosting and analytics
      providers; privacy questions can be sent to{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      The quiz is intended for a general audience and is not directed at children under 13. Because
      no personal data is collected, no parental-consent workflow is required; parents with
      questions are welcome to contact us.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes materially &mdash; for example, if a new analytics or advertising
      service is added &mdash; the updated version will be published on this page with a revised
      date before it takes effect.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
